<title>HONG KONG: Singama says to resume trading.</title>
<headline>Singama says to resume trading.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singama Container Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would resume trading of its shares and warrants on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it suspended trading at its own request on June 10 in response to concern expressed by the Securities and Futures Commission and the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong regarding the increase in both the price and trading volume of its shares.</p>
<p>The company's share was at HK$1.23 a share when it closed on June 10, up 37 percent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441  http://www.hk97.com</p>
